    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Virtual threads: no metric yet",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "ingest-gateway runs request handling on virtual threads (ADR-0006), but **no virtual-thread metric is exported**. Spring Boot registers `VirtualThreadMetrics` only when `io.micrometer:micrometer-java21` is on the classpath, and it is not a dependency of these services (checked against the Boot 3.5.3 auto-configuration, not against a running service). Adding it would expose pinned-thread and failed-submit counters. Until then, `jvm_threads_live_threads` counts platform threads only. VERIFY the metric names after adding the dependency."
      }
    }
